WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:10.810
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.510
Improve our skills?

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:08.400
Yeah, that sounds good.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.480
I'll return to my house and get some advice from my grandpa.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:15.820
Well then, I'll search for a new rose water in Tokyo.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:18.370
I'll go to my uncle's chocolate shop.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.980
In that case, I'll do some special training at my grandma's store!

