00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:08.270
<i>With that, just before heading out to my grandma's store, I ended up having to go straight home instead, and...</i>

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:12.820
H-Hey! This is unusual... Papa actually came to pick me up with the car!

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:16.360
I'm home!

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:21.070
Oh, welcome back.

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:23.090
Even Mama's like this... what's wrong?

00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:24.830
Hasn't she come out yet?

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:25.750
No...

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.790
Could it be that something happened to Natsume?

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:34.510
I wonder what happened...

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:41.510
recipe 28

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:41.510
Ichigo, Natsume and the Prince

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:44.280
Ehh? Natsume wants to stop playing piano?

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:50.360
That's right. She said that yesterday all of a sudden, and then locked herself in her room ever since.

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:54.070
What do you mean? Natsume liked piano so much, she can't be...

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:56.820
If we knew why, then we wouldn't be worrying ourselves over it.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:01.850
Natsume, it's Onee-chan!

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:05.080
Natsume, you're in there, aren't you?

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:06.680
Huh?

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:08.690
It seems like there's no one inside.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:13.830
Mama, my room seems to be occupied!

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:16.610
Natsume is using your room right now.

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:20.840
Eh? So, there's no room for me in this house then...

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:24.510
Natsume, it's Onee-chan.

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:28.640
I want to talk to you!

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:31.830
Open it! Natsume, you hear me?

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.020
Hey, Natsume!

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:39.150
I don't want to talk to anyone! Leave me alone!!

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:43.700
Ichigo, how did it go?

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:49.610
The recital is coming soon and yet...

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:53.100
At this rate, Natsume's talent won't be able to develop.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.620
We'll have to resort to force to take her to her piano lessons.

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:57.750
I think that'll have the reverse effect.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:58.420
But...

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.680
How about you leave it to me?

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:05.680
If she locked herself in yesterday, then that means Natsume hasn't eaten anything, right?

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.920
In that case, I have a good idea.

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.730
What are you going to do?

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:15.400
For Natsume's sake, I'll make a special strawberry sweet.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.490
Special sweet?

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:20.190
But... aren't you going to your uncle's place?

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:20.360
Light Wheat Flour

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:26.070
As an older sister, I'd even take off my clothes for my cute little sister!

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:28.070
Ichigo, are you going to make sweets in the nude!?

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:31.860
Did she fall <i>again?</i>

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:33.540
Ichigo, are you okay?

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:36.680
It's nothing, it's nothing.

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:38.540
Mama, we have strawberries, right?

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:42.260
Yeah. Since you said you were coming back, I bought some.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:08.650
Well then, next would be...

00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:10.240
Almond cream, right?

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:22.260
Ichigo... her skills have really improved, huh?

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:23.130
Yeah...

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:24.850
Huh?

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:33.030
Here!

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:35.480
If you have the time to look, Papa, then help me beat the egg whites.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:37.470
I-I just have to whip this, right?

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:38.330
Yeah.

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:40.020
Mama, you cut the strawberries.

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:41.260
Yes!

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:00.740
Why are you putting in pebbles?

00:06:00.740 --> 00:06:04.140
It's to prevent the edged portions of the batter from crumbling.

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:07.950
It works by putting lots of it at the sides, and a little less in the middle.

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:09.000
Oh?

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:10.950
Not bad, Ichigo.

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:12.330
Really, really!

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.430
Wow!

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:31.070
Okay, okay! You're in the way, so wait in the living room!

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:33.160
Y-Yes...

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:41.000
I smell something good...

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:45.250
It's done!

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.280
It's really well-made, isn't it?

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:49.050
I'll show this to the Queen!

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:50.770
Magical macaron.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:52.450
Sweets Romance Card.

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:54.260
Come out!

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.360
Here, dig in!

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:03.810
Did you really make this, Ichigo?

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:12.280
Delicious...

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:17.490
Before I knew it, you've already grown this much. Papa is so happy!

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:21.550
Vanilla, please.

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:22.750
Yes!

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:25.500
Magical Brilliant Breeze!

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:32.380
Huh? This smell is...

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:40.720
Here, dig in.

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:44.740
Onee-chan, it's unfair of you to use sweets to lure me out!

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:47.640
Even if you lock up yourself, it'd be a waste if you're hungry.

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:49.650
Anyway, you should at least eat the strawberry tart.

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:54.950
Your stomach is grumbling, right?

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.660
Ahh, such a nice breeze!

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:07.760
Let's sit down over there and eat it.

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:09.000
Y-Yeah.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:15.180
Why did you take me all the way over here?

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:18.930
I haven't told you about this, but...

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:24.470
Even back in the third grade, I was like you, and said that I wanted to give up playing piano.

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:27.820
I was scolded by Mama, so I hid here and cried.

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.920
Come to think of it, I remember something like that happening.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:33.600
Here, let's eat.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.660
<i>Delicious!</i>

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:41.340
Did you really make this, Onee-chan?

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:46.370
That's right. Compared to grandma's strawberry tart though, it still has a long way to go.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:52.720
That's not true at all! It's really delicious!

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:55.900
That's because you're hungry.

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:58.710
Grandma's strawberry tart is really amazing.

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:03.720
Even with just one bite, it made me smile.
A great sense of bliss just came over me!

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:06.720
I also feel a little happier, too.

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:08.420
But only a little, right?

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:10.340
Sorry...

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:18.200
Ahh! It was delicious!

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:20.870
If you want, eat this one too.

00:09:21.530 --> 00:09:22.520
You sure?

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:24.660
Thank you!

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:36.550
I meant to ask you this before, but why <i>did</i>  you give up playing piano?

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:39.530
That's because...

00:09:43.070 --> 00:09:45.730
<i>Natsume wants to play too!</i>

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:50.040
<i>Onee-chan is playing right now, isn't she? You mustn't disturb her.</i>

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:57.060
<i>Natsume wants to play! Play! I want to play!</i>

00:09:57.060 --> 00:10:00.920
<i>Mama, let's teach Natsume how to play too.</i>

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:12.500
<i>At the beginning, I did play better than you, but...</i>

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:28.940
<i>That was wonderful, Natsume!</i>

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.370
<i>As of today, you've graduated from playing Beyer.</i>

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.370
Note: Ferdinand Beyer (1803-1863), a classical musician

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:40.570
During the time that Mama opened a piano class, you had become much better than me.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:47.830
I felt that piano wasn't fun at all any more.

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:51.420
So I was the cause...

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.650
No, no! All of it was my fault.

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:58.670
I didn't put in much effort, so Mama would always get mad at me.

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:03.090
Besides, what's important is that you had a lot of fun playing.

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:09.270
After I quit playing piano, I was envious of you whom Mama has high expectations for.

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:14.280
So, I started thinking "Do I have any talents at all?"

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:17.460
I asked Papa to teach me drawing, but I gave up after 3 days.

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:21.130
Swimming. Ballet. Those didn't go too well.

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:24.620
At that time, I was cheered up by grandma's strawberry tart.

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:30.660
That could also be the time when I started to have the faint hope: "I could become a pâtissière!"

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:35.380
But, after grandma passed away, I soon forgot about that dream.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:39.300
But... right now you're doing your best at making sweets, aren't you!?

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:44.340
Yeah! When I met Henri-sensei, I remembered my dream again.

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:48.230
Now, when making sweets I can't help but have fun!

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:53.400
I'm jealous of you, Onee-chan.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:58.900
Right now... playing piano isn't any fun at all.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:02.710
Even though you were playing the piano with such confidence..?

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:21.650
Umm... Half a month ago, a boy whose skills are better than mine enrolled in the piano class.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:27.550
He was just breezing through the difficult songs that I wasn't able to grasp.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:33.120
Even though I did my best not to lose to him,

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:36.330
the more I tried, the more I felt oppressed.

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:40.120
So right now, I've completely lost interest in the piano.

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:41.990
Oh, so that's what it was, huh?

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:42.570
Eh?

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.780
But he's <i>really</i> good!

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:47.310
That's nothing to feel depressed about.

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:53.000
If that's why you were going to give up piano, then I would've given up being a pâtissière a hundred times over!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.290
Even though you can make such a delicious strawberry tart?

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.130
Well, then listen to this.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:13:01.290
Even though I have no real skills, I got recommended by Henri-sensei,

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:04.880
and was assigned to the A-group that the Sweets Princes are in!

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.460
Sweets Princes?

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:12.720
Master of sweets decoration and doing his introduction with Sweets Crafts, Hanabusa-kun.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:18.490
The son of Yumetsuki, excelling at traditional sweets, Andou-kun.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.190
The chocolate specialist, Kashino.

00:13:23.180 --> 00:13:28.530
Those three guys are handsome and also top in their classes of confectionery and regular studies.

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:32.720
I was actually assigned to a group with people of such a high level!

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:35.090
Just how many times did I want to quit?

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:38.580
Now that you mention it, there <i>was</i>  one time when you ran back home...

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:43.300
That's right. Especially that annoying Devil Kashino, always constantly scolding me!

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.640
It certainly has a beginner's taste.

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:59.810
Amano, it should now be ten days since you've received the school enrollment notice.

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:01.120
Yeah.

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:05.960
You're a year behind us, so didn't you think of practicing beforehand?

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:10.800
Perhaps you think of yourself as an idiot, hoping that someone else will teach you personally?

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:11.610
That's not...

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:15.570
You're naïve! Our aim is to become professionals!

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:17.040
If you don't have the determination, then go back home!

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:22.790
Did he really say such mean things?

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:24.300
He's a real devil, isn't he!

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:26.930
That's right... he seems scary!

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:28.720
"Scary" is too good for him!

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:30.340
Now, now...

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:31.410
Kash-

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:37.130
But then I encountered a new friend called Vanilla.

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:39.410
She made me do my best.

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:42.530
Vanilla? So there are foreign students there, too!

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:44.520
Eh? Ah, that's right.

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:50.900
Thanks to Vanilla, I slowly started to understand the joy of making sweets.

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:56.700
Also, thanks to Vanilla's special nightly training, I'm still far off, but my skills have matured quite a bit.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.860
Oh, is that so?

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:03.170
Natsume-san. If you give up, everything you did up to now will go to waste.

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:10.890
It's true that piano talent is important,
but perseverance is even more so, don't you think?

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:12.180
Onee-chan...

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.120
That's right, Amano!

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:15.760
Eh!?

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:19.900
Why are you here- Aaaah!!

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:20.750
Ichigo-chan!

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:21.760
Are you okay?

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:23.560
I believe she's okay.

00:15:22.590 --> 00:15:24.300
I'm not okay! I'm not okay!

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:25.730
She's used to that.

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:25.730
I'm not used to this!

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:28.350
Anyway, are you three the Sweets Princes?

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:28.350
Help me up! Help me, damn you!

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:29.900
That's right, Natsume-chan.

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:31.600
Here, a present.

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:34.070
For me? Thank you!

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.700
I thought I would die.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:37.680
Onee-chan!

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:38.210
Huh?

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:41.030
They're not just handsome, they're <i>super</i> handsome, aren't they!?

00:15:41.030 --> 00:15:42.420
Y-Yeah, but...

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:46.380
If they were making sweets together with such handsome guys, anyone would do their best!

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:48.420
Appearances and sweets are unrelated!

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:51.630
Onee-chan, he's scary! He's the devil, the devil!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.130
Sorry for being the devil!

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:57.140
Hey, Kashino! Don't bully my cute little sister!

00:15:57.840 --> 00:16:01.260
Now, now. Sorry for startling you, Amano-san.

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:02.890
Why are you here?

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:09.400
The three of us were supposed to improve our skills on our own, but Kashino gave us a call.

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:16.620
Kashino?

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:20.260
Eh? You're going to Ichigo-chan's grandma's store?

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:25.830
Yeah. My uncle went on a trip to Europe, so his shop is closed.

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:30.640
I have some free time, so I want to try the strawberry tart that Amano often talked about.

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:34.580
I talked to Andou earlier, and he said that he wants to go there, too.

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:38.890
I can't seem to find any good rose water, either.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:42.840
All right. For now, let's gather at Ichigo-chan's house.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:48.880
We asked your mother where you are, and she said that you probably be here, so here we are.

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:51.470
Then, our conversation just now..?

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:53.280
Sorry, we heard it.

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.440
You really were like an older sister just now.

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:57.490
If you were there, then tell me that earlier!

00:16:58.510 --> 00:17:04.540
Actually, we've already discussed this among the three of us, but we also want to make a special sweet for Natsume-chan.

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:10.020
Let's have Natsume-chan be embraced with love.

00:17:10.020 --> 00:17:11.010
Oui.

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:15.590
It's so soft!

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:17.640
I'm so excited!

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:21.310
I wonder what kind of sweets the Sweets Princes will make?

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:25.020
Sweets Princes? Is that what they're called?

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:27.010
W-Well, technically...

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:29.270
That's natural, since they're so cool!

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:32.140
P-Papa, too!

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:36.910
When I was in school, I was called the 'New Era Prince'!

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.930
Geez, Papa!

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:42.330
Stop it! That's a stupid uncle joke.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.500
Seriously. You're the shame of the Amano family!

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:46.830
You look so pathetic in front of the Sweets Princes.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:51.040
Mama too, what's with you? You're not going out, yet you're putting on makeup.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:53.710
This is proper etiquette to welcoming super handsome guys.

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:56.370
Isn't putting makeup overdoing it?

00:17:56.370 --> 00:17:58.300
It's really tiring to hide those wrinkles.

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:00.230
What did you say!?

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:06.330
Stop it, you two! The Sweets Princes will laugh at you!

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:10.520
W-We apologise!

00:18:11.930 --> 00:18:14.930
Hey, let's peek on them a little!

00:18:17.100 --> 00:18:19.660
Ah! Ichigo and Vanilla!

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:24.660
W-What? It's fine letting me see a bit, right?

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:25.890
No!

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:26.750
Means no!

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:30.500
If we let you see before it's done, there won't be a surprise anymore and it'll become boring, won't it?

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:33.130
Sorry about this, but you'll have to wait patiently.

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:36.100
It's about time the sponge cake is baked.

00:18:36.100 --> 00:18:36.840
I'll take it out.

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:39.150
Help me shape it while you're at it.

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:40.050
Roger.

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:41.440
What's with them!?

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:43.190
Hey, hey, Ichigo!

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:45.580
Which one of them are you interested in?

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:47.130
N-None of them...

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:50.340
You don't have to be embarassed! C'mon, who is it?

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:53.760
Is it Hanabusa-kun? His smile is really nice.

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:58.630
He'd definitely escort you kindly, making you feel like a princess.

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:02.530
Or is it Andou-kun? His confidence is just overflowing, isn't it?

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:06.950
His serious attitude matches perfectly with your clumsiness!

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:11.330
Oh my, Kashino-kun!? Are you attracted to his coolness?

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:15.750
It could turn out bad, though. He might not really suit you.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:17.280
So, who is it?

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:22.340
Well, that's fine. Mama is fine with you marrying one of the three.

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:24.200
M-Marrying!?

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:26.910
Papa definitely won't allow this!

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:30.140
Why not? You'd be able to get such a handsome son-in-law!

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:30.140
No, no, no, no, no, no, no!

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.670
Mama, what are you-

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:33.770
Geez, stop it, you two!

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:39.360
Those three are my teammates! We're fighting together in the Cake Grand Prix...

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:40.780
That's right! They're my comrades!

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:43.520
Comrades, huh?

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:45.410
Well, that's fine.

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:47.490
Yeah. It's just like Amano-san.

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:49.000
Comrades, comrades.

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:55.220
Amazing! It's a grand piano-shaped cake!

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:56.830
It looks really professional!

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:59.160
It'd be a waste to eat it.

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:02.720
We made this for you from the bottom of our hearts.

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:04.550
Thank you!

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:06.550
Isn't that great, Natsume?

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:07.580
Yeah!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:13.650
The white part of the keyboard is condensed milk while the black part is bean paste, right?

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:15.370
As expected of Andou-kun!

00:20:15.870 --> 00:20:17.940
The chocolate cake's superb!

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:19.430
Thank you very much.

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:23.360
That doll looks exactly like Natsume.

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:24.830
That's made by Hanabusa-kun.

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:27.200
Instead of eating it, I'll keep it!

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:31.440
Sweets Princes, thank you!

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:33.630
You're welcome.

00:20:33.630 --> 00:20:35.500
It's our pleasure to make you happy.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.910
Onee-chan.

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:42.360
I really worship you for being able to do your best and working together with the Sweets Princes!

00:20:42.360 --> 00:20:44.060
Worshiping is kind of-

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:45.050
No, it's amazing!

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:47.720
I'll do my best and continue playing piano!

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:50.390
Natsume...

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:58.330
If it's Natsume, it'll be okay.

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:00.150
It will definitely turn out well.

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:05.530
Onee-chan...

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:19.840
<i>Thank you, Onee-chan.</i>

