00:23:11.310 --> 00:23:15.920
Pour sugar and almond together in a bowl, and mix them well.

00:23:19.130 --> 00:23:24.230
In there, add a little egg white and knead well to mix it together.

00:23:25.490 --> 00:23:28.560
The hardness can be adjusted by the amount of egg white.

00:23:28.560 --> 00:23:31.510
If it's too hard, add a little bit of egg white.

00:23:33.480 --> 00:23:39.010
